OL,3,GNEWSASilverstone announces launch of
OL,4,Acharity foundation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe home of British motorsport has
OL,7,Flaunched a new charity set to support
OL,8,Fcauses dedicated to children.
OL,10,FThe Silverstone Foundation was created
OL,11,Fafter events at the Northamptonshire
OL,12,Fcircuit raised more than #1m for
OL,13,Fchildren's charities in 2026.
OL,15,FNext year, the foundation will support
OL,16,Fseveral charities including BBC
OL,17,FChildren in Need, Rainbow Trust
OL,18,FChildren's Charity and the Teenage
OL,19,FCancer Trust.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
