OL,3,GNEWSASilverstone announces launch of
OL,4,Acharity foundation
OL,5,
OL,6,FDarren Beddard, chair of the trustees
OL,7,Fand chief financial officer at
OL,8,FSilverstone, said: "Selecting this
OL,9,Fyear's charities was an incredibly
OL,10,Fdifficult task, as every applicant
OL,11,Fmakes a significant contribution to the
OL,12,Flives of children in the UK."
